1
00:00:00,964 --> 00:00:02,934
♪ Bang! ♪

2
00:00:02,931 --> 00:00:05,431
♪ The Big Bang Theory 9x02 ♪
The Separation Oscillation
Original Air Date on September

3
00:00:05,493 --> 00:00:07,493
== sync, corrected by elderman ==
@elder_man

4
00:00:08,118 --> 00:00:10,418
(Skype ringing)

5
00:00:10,420 --> 00:00:12,720
(Amy(on skype):)Sheldon, I don't think
you understand

6
00:00:12,722 --> 00:00:14,192
(Amy(on skype):)how being broken up works.

7
00:00:14,191 --> 00:00:16,461
(Amy(on skype):)The only way
I can sort through my feelings

8
00:00:16,460 --> 00:00:18,230
(Amy(on skype):)is if there is space between us.

9
00:00:18,228 --> 00:00:21,198
(Amy(on skype):)Every time I see you,
it re-traumatizes me.

10
00:00:21,198 --> 00:00:23,328
(Amy(on skype):)I go through the pain
all over again.

11
00:00:23,333 --> 00:00:25,503
(Sheldon:)Well, hello to you, too.

12
00:00:26,570 --> 00:00:28,270
(Amy:)What do you want?

13
00:00:28,271 --> 00:00:30,441
(Sheldon:)I understand
we're no longer a couple,

14
00:00:30,440 --> 00:00:34,010
(Sheldon:)but I would like to remind you
that we made a baby together.

15
00:00:36,213 --> 00:00:38,013
(Amy:)What baby?

16
00:00:38,014 --> 00:00:41,014
(Sheldon:)A precocious
little Internet show

17
00:00:41,017 --> 00:00:43,587
known as "Fun With Flags."

18
00:00:44,454 --> 00:00:46,084
(Amy:)I'm hanging up.

19
00:00:46,089 --> 00:00:48,219
(Sheldon:)Great. See you in
about half an hour.

20
00:00:48,225 --> 00:00:51,825
(Amy:)Sheldon, I am not doing
"Fun With Flags" with you.

21
00:00:51,828 --> 00:00:52,998
(Sheldon:)Why not?

22
00:00:52,996 --> 00:00:54,926
(Amy:)Because we're broken up.

23
00:00:54,931 --> 00:00:56,901
(Sheldon:)Sonny and Cher made it work.

24
00:00:56,900 --> 00:00:58,770
(Sheldon:)Their variety show
kept going

25
00:00:58,768 --> 00:00:59,838
(Sheldon:)long after the divorce,

26
00:00:59,836 --> 00:01:02,466
(Sheldon:)and here we are
still talking about them.

